File Index: 10 of 109
Audio ID: 7694204222564930235
Audio Duration: 2m 57.4s (177.40s)
Start Time (Malaysia): 2026-11-10 08:11:14 +08
Detected Language: zh (Prob: 1.00)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,900] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 15 | Text: 从年人顶级的自律从来不是拼命赚钱
Segment #2   [00:00:02,900 --> 00:00:04,340] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 而是好好管住自己的嘴
Segment #3   [00:00:04,340 --> 00:00:06,920] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 13 | Text: 真正的抚养自己无需昂贵的物质
Segment #4   [00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:09,200] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 14 | Text: 养好一张富贵嘴就赢了大半人生
Segment #5   [00:00:09,200 --> 00:00:11,780] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 13 | Text: 老话讲 少说是服务 闭嘴是修行
Segment #6   [00:00:12,140 --> 00:00:14,640] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 14 | Text: 人这一辈子大半的灾祸 烦恼是非
Segment #7   [00:00:14,640 --> 00:00:16,280] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 7  | Text: 全都是嘴上招来的
Segment #8   [00:00:16,280 --> 00:00:18,700] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 12 | Text: 读懂这十句话 借掉口无遮拦
Segment #9   [00:00:18,700 --> 00:00:21,280] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 13 | Text: 你的服务器和运事都会悄悄翻盘
Segment #10  [00:00:21,680 --> 00:00:23,940] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 9  | Text: 第一 言多必失 甚言保命
Segment #11  [00:00:23,940 --> 00:00:26,540] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 14 | Text: 闭嘴从来不是懦弱 而是清醒的自保
Segment #12  [00:00:26,540 --> 00:00:28,400] | Elapsed:  15.58s | Words: 8  | Text: 没实力的时候少说多做
Segment #13  [00:00:28,400 --> 00:00:30,300] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 9  | Text: 身处低谷的时候沉默藏风
Segment #14  [00:00:30,300 --> 00:00:32,760] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 12 | Text: 水太深 风太大 不懂得不插话
Segment #15  [00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:34,980] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 12 | Text: 看清位置 管住嘴巴 群居手口
Segment #16  [00:00:34,980 --> 00:00:37,060] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 独处手心 方能远离纷争
Segment #17  [00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:39,660] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 13 | Text: 第二 层次越高的人越不爱指点别人
Segment #18  [00:00:39,660 --> 00:00:41,640] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 永远不要随意评判他人的人生
Segment #19  [00:00:41,640 --> 00:00:44,180] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 15 | Text: 更不要轻易给别人建议 替别人做决定
Segment #20  [00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,180] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 每个人都有自己的因果和渡口
Segment #21  [00:00:46,180 --> 00:00:47,580] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 你的多言不仅是多语
Segment #22  [00:00:47,580 --> 00:00:48,920] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 8  | Text: 还会无端战然是非
Segment #23  [00:00:48,920 --> 00:00:50,880] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 10 | Text: 位置不同 少言为贵 认知不同
Segment #24  [00:00:50,880 --> 00:00:53,080] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 13 | Text: 不争不变 三观不合 绝不费口舌
Segment #25  [00:00:53,560 --> 00:00:55,700] | Elapsed:  35.05s | Words: 11 | Text: 第三 未经他人苦 莫劝他人善
Segment #26  [00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:57,780] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 10 | Text: 你没经历过别人的坎坷
Segment #27  [00:00:57,780 --> 00:00:59,800] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 11 | Text: 就没资格评判别人的选择
Segment #28  [00:00:59,800 --> 00:01:01,300] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 旁观者永远轻飘飘
Segment #29  [00:01:01,300 --> 00:01:02,800] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 局内人才知万般难
Segment #30  [00:01:02,800 --> 00:01:04,300] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 5  | Text: 你看到了只是表象
Segment #31  [00:01:04,300 --> 00:01:05,960] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 11 | Text: 看不懂别人的仪人有无奈
Segment #32  [00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,180] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 不评价 不指责
Segment #33  [00:01:07,180 --> 00:01:08,780] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 7  | Text: 是做人最大的善良
Segment #34  [00:01:08,780 --> 00:01:10,360] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 第四 收起你的表达欲
Segment #35  [00:01:10,360 --> 00:01:11,520] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 借掉你的倾诉隐
Segment #36  [00:01:11,520 --> 00:01:14,160] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 15 | Text: 成年人最顶级的情形是分清两件事
Segment #37  [00:01:14,160 --> 00:01:15,340] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 我的事与你何干
Segment #38  [00:01:15,340 --> 00:01:16,520] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 6  | Text: 你的事与我何干
Segment #39  [00:01:16,520 --> 00:01:18,760] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 12 | Text: 无关的事不听不看 不问不说
Segment #40  [00:01:18,760 --> 00:01:20,720] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 12 | Text: 不晒心情 不吐苦水 不漏底牌
Segment #41  [00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:22,240] | Elapsed:  54.16s | Words: 8  | Text: 默默沉淀 悄悄成长
Segment #42  [00:01:22,240 --> 00:01:24,960] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 12 | Text: 第五 永远不要和不同认知的人争辩
Segment #43  [00:01:25,440 --> 00:01:26,920] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 三观不同 无必相容
Segment #44  [00:01:26,920 --> 00:01:28,460] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 认知不已 无需说服
Segment #45  [00:01:28,460 --> 00:01:31,100] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 14 | Text: 每个人都困在自己的认知里讲道理
Segment #46  [00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,640] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 9  | Text: 争辩到最后 赢了口舌
Segment #47  [00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:34,000] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 输了心情 耗了精力
Segment #48  [00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,380] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 真正有格局的人
Segment #49  [00:01:35,380 --> 00:01:36,780] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 从不与人争论长短
Segment #50  [00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:38,240] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 只专注自己的人生
Segment #51  [00:01:38,240 --> 00:01:39,840] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 第六 时人不善
Segment #52  [00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:41,340] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 即刻沉默远离
Segment #53  [00:01:41,340 --> 00:01:42,480] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 遇到心情不正
Segment #54  [00:01:42,480 --> 00:01:43,520] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 5  | Text: 三观相辈的人
Segment #55  [00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:44,980] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 不用争辩 不用纠缠
Segment #56  [00:01:44,980 --> 00:01:46,060] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 4  | Text: 不必说服
Segment #57  [00:01:46,060 --> 00:01:47,460] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 7  | Text: 多说一句都是消耗
Segment #58  [00:01:47,460 --> 00:01:48,780] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 6  | Text: 多辩一次都是内耗
Segment #59  [00:01:48,780 --> 00:01:50,600] | Elapsed:  73.34s | Words: 8  | Text: 天与不认 无根之草
Segment #60  [00:01:50,600 --> 00:01:51,980] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 佛法不渡 无缘之人
Segment #61  [00:01:51,980 --> 00:01:53,860] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 即使沉默 果断远离
Segment #62  [00:01:53,860 --> 00:01:55,240] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 就是护好自己的能量
Segment #63  [00:01:55,640 --> 00:01:57,360] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 第七 真正厉害的人
Segment #64  [00:01:57,360 --> 00:01:58,180] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 从不炫耀
Segment #65  [00:01:58,180 --> 00:01:59,960] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 12 | Text: 你的优秀无须滴滴不休的证明
Segment #66  [00:01:59,960 --> 00:02:01,340] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 9  | Text: 无须夸夸其残的张扬
Segment #67  [00:02:01,340 --> 00:02:02,780] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 炫耀只会遭嫉妒
Segment #68  [00:02:02,780 --> 00:02:03,900] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 肃敌人 引是非
Segment #69  [00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:05,380] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 7  | Text: 越是实力过硬的人
Segment #70  [00:02:05,380 --> 00:02:06,380] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 6  | Text: 越是低调沉默
Segment #71  [00:02:06,380 --> 00:02:07,800] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 8  | Text: 沉经内脸 自带光芒
Segment #72  [00:02:07,800 --> 00:02:09,920] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 10 | Text: 第八 人际交往最大的忌讳
Segment #73  [00:02:09,920 --> 00:02:11,160] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 就是交浅延伸
Segment #74  [00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:12,260] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 4  | Text: 交情浅薄
Segment #75  [00:02:12,260 --> 00:02:13,260] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 5  | Text: 别逃行逃废
Segment #76  [00:02:13,260 --> 00:02:15,140] | Elapsed:  92.80s | Words: 9  | Text: 关系一般 别直言不惠
Segment #77  [00:02:15,140 --> 00:02:17,760] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 16 | Text: 一时的情书欲往往会成为日后的软肋
Segment #78  [00:02:17,760 --> 00:02:19,360] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 人前 手口 人后 手心
Segment #79  [00:02:19,360 --> 00:02:21,480] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 几分情义 说几分话语分寸感
Segment #80  [00:02:21,480 --> 00:02:23,260] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 10 | Text: 才是成千人的社交底牌
Segment #81  [00:02:23,600 --> 00:02:25,060] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 7  | Text: 第九 顶级的修养
Segment #82  [00:02:25,060 --> 00:02:26,100] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 是看破不说破
Segment #83  [00:02:26,100 --> 00:02:27,620] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 看清一件事不必揭穿
Segment #84  [00:02:27,620 --> 00:02:29,420] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 8  | Text: 看透一个人不必点破
Segment #85  [00:02:29,420 --> 00:02:31,740] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 知人不平 知事不严 知理不变
Segment #86  [00:02:31,740 --> 00:02:34,140] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 14 | Text: 笑而不语是获达 痛而不言 是历练
Segment #87  [00:02:34,500 --> 00:02:36,220] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 9  | Text: 成熟从来不是尖锐通透
Segment #88  [00:02:36,220 --> 00:02:37,340] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 而是温柔看淡
Segment #89  [00:02:37,340 --> 00:02:39,160] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 6  | Text: 第十 嘴不及德
Segment #90  [00:02:39,160 --> 00:02:41,940] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 福字流失 并从口入或从口出
Segment #91  [00:02:41,940 --> 00:02:44,340] | Elapsed: 112.21s | Words: 12 | Text: 刻薄的话语是伤人害己的利刃
Segment #92  [00:02:45,140 --> 00:02:47,940] | Elapsed: 123.52s | Words: 17 | Text: 心有柔软 一张刻薄嘴也会散尽半生福气
Segment #93  [00:02:47,940 --> 00:02:50,720] | Elapsed: 123.53s | Words: 12 | Text: 好好说话是修养 更是积攒好运
Segment #94  [00:02:50,720 --> 00:02:52,840] | Elapsed: 123.53s | Words: 11 | Text: 往后余生修好这张富贵嘴
Segment #95  [00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:55,560] | Elapsed: 123.53s | Words: 14 | Text: 少言深言寡言 福气自会长半身旁
Segment #96  [00:02:55,560 --> 00:02:57,300] | Elapsed: 123.53s | Words: 10 | Text: 加油陌生人 祝你们越来越好
